# Product Requirement Document (PRD) & Business Architecture: AstroSole

**Tagline:** *Astrology of Your Sole*  
**Author:** CTO & Senior Product Manager  
**Version:** 1.0.0 (Enterprise Full-Stack Architecture)  
**Status:** Active Production Blueprint  

---

## 1. Executive Summary & Product Vision

### 1.1 Product Vision
**AstroSole** is an AI-powered Podomancy (Solistry) web platform that bridges ancient foot astrology with modern computer vision telemetry. By analyzing bare foot sole contours, arch shapes, toe alignments, and planetary birth charts, AstroSole delivers personalized readings for career, health, relationships, and karmic path, while connecting seekers directly with expert astrologers.

### 1.2 Value Proposition
* **For Seekers:** Immediate, intuitive, and highly personalized astrological insights derived from the physical foundation of their body (the sole), combined with Vedic birth chart calculations.
* **For Astrologers & Business:** High-converting lead generation funnel for deep-dive consultations, remedies, gemstones, and personalized cosmic footwear.

---

## 2. User Personas & Target Audience

| Persona | Demographics & Profile | Needs & Pain Points | AstroSole Solution |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Cosmic Seeker (Primary)** | Age 22–45, interested in astrology, Tarot, palmistry, and wellness. | Wants instant, visually engaging predictions without complex birth time requirements. | 3-step foot scan with real-time AI visual telemetry and instant report. |
| **Guidance Seeker (Secondary)** | Age 30–60, facing career transitions or relationship challenges. | Seeking authentic human astrologer consultation and actionable remedies. | One-click WhatsApp/Email booking with sacred astrologer consultation. |
| **Astrologer / Partner** | Verified Vedic Astrologer / Solistry Expert. | Requires high-intent leads with pre-analyzed foot telemetry data. | Direct lead dispatch containing seeker birth info & sole telemetry coordinates. |

---

## 3. Core Features & Functional Requirements

### 3.1 Landing & Onboarding (`Home.tsx`)
* **Hero Banner with Dynamic Visuals:** High-impact cosmic visual theme, featuring animated background overlays and gold luxury aesthetics.
* **Multilingual Support:** One-tap toggle between **English** and **Hindi** (`en` / `hi`).
* **Daily Horoscope Carousel:** Interactive sign-by-sign horoscope scroll component (`HoroscopeCarousel.tsx`).
* **Podomancy Educational Modal:** Informative guide explaining the ancient roots of solistry and bilateral foot symmetry.
* **Lead Capture CTA:** Direct buttons for "Start Foot Reading", "Talk to Astrologer" (WhatsApp), and "Email Us".

### 3.2 Foot Telemetry & Verification Scan (`Scan.tsx`)
* **Image Capture / Upload:** Mobile camera integration with environment capture preference and client-side canvas image compression (down to 800px max dimension, ~80KB payload).
* **AI Image Verification (`gemini.ts`):** Multi-model rotation (`gemini-2.5-flash-lite`, `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`, `gemini-2.5-flash`) verifying the upload is a bare human foot sole and strictly rejecting hands, animals, or objects.
* **Interactive Alignment Overlay:** Visual guide box ensuring vertical sole alignment.
* **Seeker Metadata Form:** Name, Email, Phone, Birth Date, Birth Time, Birth Place, and Gender collection.

### 3.3 Solistry Calculation Engine (`podomancy.ts`)
* **Foot Shape Classification:** Structural mapping across Roman (Earth), Egyptian (Water), Greek (Fire), and Square (Air) feet shapes.
* **Line & Arch Telemetry:** Curve curvature, high arch vs. flat arch, and destiny line depth scoring.
* **Bilateral Symmetry Mirroring:** Algorithmic mirror symmetry mapping active (right) vs. passive (left) foot dimensions.
* **Deterministic Fallback:** Guarantees instantaneous reading generation even if cloud AI services experience rate limits or timeouts.

### 3.4 Interactive Result & Report Page (`Result.tsx`)
* **Constellation Foot Visualizer:** Interactive SVG foot constellation mapping energy nodes (Career, Health, Love, Fate).
* **Detailed Predictions:** Multi-category insights for Career, Health, Love, Destiny, and Remedies.
* **Printable / Sharable Report:** Downloadable PDF report and 1-click WhatsApp share string with custom URL branding.
* **Razorpay Payment Gateway:** Integrated ₹11 payment trigger for unlocking premium reports or direct consultation passes.

